-- expect-refusal: function dsr_mix: key (a) has two values in the book main: (1) and (2)
-- a base fact and a conclusion of a rule break it together: the check reads what is asserted and what is derived alike
edb(dsr_src).
dsr_src(a, 2).
function dsr_mix(K, to V).
dsr_mix(a, 1).
dsr_mix(K, V) :- dsr_src(K, V).
